          "text": "Recorded 24 steps.\n  Step 00: Start: dist[1]=0, all others=inf. Will run up to 6 iterations over 10 directed edges.\n  Step 01: Iteration 1/6: examine all 10 directed edges.\n  Step 02: Iter 1: relax 1->2 (w=6), dist[2] improved to 6\n  Step 03: Iter 1: relax 1->3 (w=5), dist[3] improved to 5\n  Step 04: Iter 1: relax 1->4 (w=5), dist[4] improved to 5\n  Step 05: Iter 1: relax 2->5 (w=-1), dist[5] improved to 5\n  Step 06: Iter 1: relax 3->2 (w=-2), dist[2] improved to 3\n  Step 07: Iter 1: relax 4->3 (w=-2), dist[3] improved to 3\n  Step 08: Iter 1: relax 4->6 (w=-1), dist[6] improved to 4\n  Step 09: Iter 1: relax 5->7 (w=3), dist[7] improved to 8\n  Step 10: Iter 1: relax 6->7 (w=3), dist[7] improved to 7\n  Step 11: Iter 1/6 done. Updated: 2=3, 3=3, 4=5, 5=5, 6=4, 7=7\n  Step 12: Iteration 2/6: examine all 10 directed edges.\n  Step 13: Iter 2: relax 2->5 (w=-1), dist[5] improved to 2\n  Step 14: Iter 2: relax 3->2 (w=-2), dist[2] improved to 1\n  Step 15: Iter 2: relax 5->7 (w=3), dist[7] improved to 5\n  Step 16: Iter 2/6 done. Updated: 5=2, 2=1, 7=5\n  Step 17: Iteration 3/6: examine all 10 directed edges.\n  Step 18: Iter 3: relax 2->5 (w=-1), dist[5] improved to 0\n  Step 19: Iter 3: relax 5->7 (w=3), dist[7] improved to 3\n  Step 20: Iter 3/6 done. Updated: 5=0, 7=3\n  Step 21: Iteration 4/6: examine all 10 directed edges.\n  Step 22: Iter 4/6: no improvements — converged early.\n  Step 23: Done! Shortest path 1->7: 1 -> 4 -> 3 -> 2 -> 5 -> 7  (cost=3)",
